            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Edith 1.3.0</h2>
<h3>Line height setting</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Editor Defaults gains a Line Height slider (1.0&times; to 2.0&times;). The chosen spacing applies immediately to open documents, carries into new text as you type, and persists across launches.</li>
  <li>Line numbers in the gutter and invisible-character markers now align to the text baseline, so they stay in step with the text at any line height.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
